%abc-2.1
X: 1752893820
T: The Nine Points of Roguery
T: a.k.a. The Black Mare of Fanad
C: Trad.
R: reel
M: 4/4
Q: 1/2=105
S: _Ho-ro-gheallaidh_ vol. 1; Maggie Sansone (Mist and Stone, 1990); my own additions.
Z: Cameron Cross
N: It seems the standard version of this tune is to play Em over the 4th measure, with the melody 
N: BEEE BEGE (in both octaves).  However, Maggie, as a dulcimer player, has no problem going up 
N: to a C and then down to the Em chord.  I really like that, so I've adapted it to a fiddle-friendly 
N: arrangement.
K: Dmaj
